   "partialWhy": "One piece of one of its seven books. The Apocalypse of Peter survives embedded in the Ethiopic Books of Clement and M. R. James translated that Ethiopic in 1924 — but only as far as the point where he judged the rest of it late, saying so and stopping. The other six books have no public-domain English translation at all. What is here is worth reading and is not the book.",
